  "verseCount": 6,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Libirana lia Yeremia no Musaayi Pashihuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaayi Pashihuri, okhwa Imeri, owaba omwimeelesi we Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aulila Yeremia ne ang'oola bibiindu bino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Pashihuri arusia lilaka bape Yeremia mala amure khu minyololo embi ne silibwa sia ngaaki sie kholo eya Benjamini mu Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bwasia, Pashihuri alekhuula Yeremia khukhwama khu minyololo. Nio Yeremia amuboolela ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi se alakhulaanga lisina liowo, ali Pashihuri lundi tawe, ne kakhali alakhulaanga ali, ‘Liriisia buli Lubeka.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, ‘Lola ese ndakhukhola ewe obe liriisia khu wamwene ne khu basaale bowo boosi. Balererwa mwiie ne basiku babwe ewe nololeleele. Ne ese khaane Yuda sioosi mu bunyali bwo mwami owa Babiloni. Ne akhababukule abayile Babiloni mu mbaambe mala ese khaberere ebweeneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako khaane kimiaandu kie lukoba lwa Yuda kioosi ne bibiindu bie bukhala nende bie bukusi bwe angaaki ne libiikhilo lie babaami ba Yuda mu bunyali bwe basiku babwe. Baliyaaya kimiaandu kiabwe ne khubaamba babayile e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ewe Pashihuri, ne bamenyile munju mwowo boosi mukhache mu mbaambe e Babiloni, mala mukhafwiile ebweeneyo ne khusiikhwa ebweeneyo, ewe ne basaale bowo boosi nibo wang'oolelanga ke bubeeyi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia eloocha khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
